produced softer fruit, and the nitrogen concentration in the pulp of these kiwifruits at harvest was negatively correlated with fruit firmness measured after 75 days at 0 degrees C + 4 days at 20 degrees C."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Converis"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""1"", """", """", """", ""10.17660/ActaHortic.2015.1096.38"", """", """", """", ""2406-6168"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0567-7572"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:84950341517"", """", ""https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/267006||https://doi.org/10.17660/ActaHortic.2015.1096.38"", """", ""WOS:000378638100038"", """", ""Facultad de Agronomía e Ingenieria Forestal; Zoffoli Guerra, Juan Pablo; 0000-0003-0455-8477; 58311"", """", """", """", """", ""en"", """", """", """", """", """", ""contenido parcial"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Acta Horticulturae"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso restringido"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Understanding postharvest quality of kiwifruit in relation to shoot and cane vigor"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Understanding postharvest quality of kiwifruit in relation to shoot and cane vigor"", ""comunicación de congreso"", """", """", """", """", """", ""1096"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si"", """", """", ""58311"", """", ""3/14/2025"", """", """", """", ""2025-03-14;58311;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""WOS||Scopus||Pubmed"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Converis;20-07-2021"", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""OSDG;2025-12-22"", """", """", """", ""Vali