40749d97-8c1e-4c73-a803-87620c5a7235,888943bf-3640-4bb1-8261-0ce3ad3090bd,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""40749d97-8c1e-4c73-a803-87620c5a7235"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""yvc"", """", """", """", """", ""Alcalde Silva, Jaime Cristóbal"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2020-08-05T19:02:09Z||2026-07-20T16:00:56Z"", """", ""2020-08-05T19:02:09Z||2026-07-20T16:00:56Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2017"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Las cartas de patrocinio, como una forma de garantía atípica en la práctica bancaria chilena, han sido estudiadas por la doctrina en cuanto a su naturaleza y efecto vinculante. Sin embargo, y a diferencia del derecho comparado, los tribunales chilenos no tuvieron ocasión de pronunciarse sobre la fuerza obligatoria de estos documentos hasta hace algunos años (2011). Analizaremos dicha sentencia para determinar cuáles fueron los criterios utilizados en ella, comentando los aspectos más relevantes de la decisión de la Corte Suprema, incluidos aquellos omitidos, y ofreciendo nuestras conclusiones sobre el particular.||Comfort letters, as a form of atypical guarantee in the Chilean banking practice, have been studied by the doctrine as to its nature and binding effects. However, unlike comparative law, the Chilean courts had no opportunity to rule on the binding force of these documents until a few years ago (2011). We will analyze this judgment to determine which criteria were used in it, commenting on the most relevant aspects of the decision of the Supreme Court, including those omitted, and offering our conclusions on the matter."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""7/15/2026"", """", """", ""31 páginas"", """", """", """", ""Repositorio UC||SIPA"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4067/s0718-591x2017000200039"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0303-9986"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/218476||https://doi.org/10.4067/s0718-591x2017000200039||https://dialnet.unirioja.es/servlet/articulo?codigo=6736031"", """", """", """", ""FACULTAD DE DERECHO;ALCALDE SILVA JAIME CRISTOBAL;S/I;120223||Facultad de Derecho; Alcalde Silva Jaime Cristobal; 0000-0003-4732-5585; 120223"", """", ""No. 242||242"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", ""cotenido completo"", """", ""69"", """", ""39"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista de Derecho||Revista de Derecho (Universidad de Concepción)"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""340"", """", """", """", ""Derecho"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Cartas de patrocinio||Garantía (garantía atípica)||Derecho bancario||Jurisprudencia||Comfort letters||guarantee (atypical guarantee)||Banking law||Case law"", """", """", """", """", ""Las cartas de patrocinio y su recuperación en el Derecho chileno. Notas a propósito de una sentencia de la Corte Suprema||Las cartas de patrocinio y su recepción en el derecho chile. Notas a propósito de una sentencia de la Corte Suprema"", """", """", ""The comfort letters and its reception in chilean law. Notes about a sentence of the supreme court"", """", """", ""Las cartas de patrocinio y su recuperación en el Derecho chileno. Notas a propósito de una sentencia de la Corte Suprema||Las cartas de patrocinio y su recepción en el derecho chile. Notas a propósito de una sentencia de la Corte Suprema"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""85"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si"", """", """", ""120223"", """", ""2026-07-15;1091832;1"", """", """", """", ""2020-08-05;120223;1||2026-07-15;1091832;1||2026-07-24;120223;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""db53cbf2-9fd7-45f6-bbae-8b80df21d3ba"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Dialnet;05-08-2020||Repositorio UC;08-07-2021"", """", """", ""Validado"", """", """", """", ""Unpaywall"", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2020-08-05;120223;1||2026-07-24;120223;1"", """"]","[""888943bf-3640-4bb1-8261-0ce3ad3090bd"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""yvc"", """", """", """", """", ""Alcalde Silva, Jaime Cristóbal"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-07-20T16:00:56Z"", """", ""2026-07-20T16:00:56Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2017"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Las cartas de patrocinio, como una forma de garantía atípica en la práctica bancaria chilena, han sido estudiadas por la doctrina en cuanto a su naturaleza y efecto vinculante. Sin embargo, y a diferencia del derecho comparado, los tribunales chilenos no tuvieron ocasión de pronunciarse sobre la fuerza obligatoria de estos documentos hasta hace algunos años (2011). Analizaremos dicha sentencia para determinar cuáles fueron los criterios utilizados en ella, comentando los aspectos más relevantes de la decisión de la Corte Suprema, incluidos aquellos omitidos, y ofreciendo nuestras conclusiones sobre el particular.||Comfort letters, as a form of atypical guarantee in the Chilean banking practice, have been studied by the doctrine as to its nature and binding effects. However, unlike comparative law, the Chilean courts had no opportunity to rule on the binding force of these documents until a few years ago (2011). We will analyze this judgment to determine which criteria were used in it, commenting on the most relevant aspects of the decision of the Supreme Court, including those omitted, and offering our conclusions on the matter."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""7/15/2026"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SIPA"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""http://dx.doi.org/10.4067/S0718-591X2017000200039||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/424394"", """", """", """", ""Facultad de Derecho; Alcalde Silva Jaime Cristobal; 0000-0003-4732-5585; 120223"", """", ""242"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", ""cotenido completo"", """", ""69"", """", ""39"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista de Derecho (Universidad de Concepción)"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""340"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Cartas de patrocinio||Garantía (garantía atípica)||Derecho bancario||Jurisprudencia||Comfort letters||guarantee (atypical guarantee)||Banking law||Case law"", """", """", """", """", ""Las cartas de patrocinio y su recepción en el derecho chile. Notas a propósito de una sentencia de la Corte Suprema"", """", """", ""The comfort letters and its reception in chilean law. Notes about a sentence of the supreme court"", """", """", ""Las cartas de patrocinio y su recepción en el derecho chile. Notas a propósito de una sentencia de la Corte Suprema"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""85"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""120223"", """", ""2026-07-15;1091832;1"", """", """", """", ""2026-07-15;1091832;1||2026-07-24;120223;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-07-24;120223;1"", """"]"
