c92f19fc-346f-46b1-a403-2aee59daaf34,975c40fc-b111-4877-88a3-c04f77c5f915,identifier,"transitive_match; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.doi,dc.identifier.uri,dc.identifier.wosid",identifier_conflict,"[""c92f19fc-346f-46b1-a403-2aee59daaf34"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Espinosa Hernández, Patricia"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2020-07-11T21:29:25Z||2020-08-07T13:54:13Z||2020-07-02T23:21:11Z||2020-10-14T19:02:27Z"", """", ""2020-07-11T21:29:25Z||2020-08-07T13:54:13Z||2020-07-02T23:21:11Z||2020-10-14T19:02:27Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2016||2017||2000"", """", """", """", """", """", ""This article presents evidence of both the ways in which memory is constructed and the crisis of representation in the novel El paso de los gansos (1975) by Fernando Alegria (1918-2005). This volume gives prominence to Cristian Montealegre, a photographer and victim of the repression, whose photographies are testimony of his experience within the context of the first two months of the dictatorship. On this way, one of the two first Chilean antidictatorship novels exposes the coup d'etat and the crisis of this fact unleashes through the intensification of the relationship between word and image.||This article addresses the exercise of literary criticism in Chile in the context of the increasingly complex practices of denial of dissent. The non-acceptance of difference that entraps the Chilean society eliminates the discordances by avoiding discourse diversity. The market, then, turns literary criticism into one more link of a book's distribution channels and into a component of the advertising campaign. The crisis that literary criticism and our literature are going through represents only a fraction of the cultural catastrophe brought about by the commercialization of reality as a whole. We are now witnessing a privatization of critical thinking and, consequently, a neutralization of subjectivities; I therefore maintain how urgent it is to, from the reduced territory of subjectivity, vindicate criticism as an act of cultural resistance."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""6 páginas||14 páginas||10 páginas"", """", """", """", ""Repositorio UC"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.5195/CT/2017.250"", """", """", """", ""0568-3939"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0718-7181"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/260120||https://doi.org/10.4067/S0718-71812016000200023"", """", ""WOS:000424162600021"", """", ""INSTITUTO DE ESTÉTICA;ESPINOSA HERNANDEZ PATRICIA CECILIA;S/I;78572"", """", ""No. 60||No. 6||No. 9||No. 33"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""316||14||535||114"", """", ""311||1||522||105"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Aisthesis||CATEDRAL TOMADA-REVISTA DE CRITICA LITERARIA LATINOAMERICANA-JOURNAL OF LATIN AMERICAN LITERARY CRITICISM||Catedral Tomada||Aisthesis: Revista chilena de investigaciones estéticas"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""800"", """", """", """", ""Literatura"", ""11 Sustainable cities and communities"", """", ""11 Ciudades y comunidades sostenibles"", """", """", """", ""Novelas - Chile||Literatura chilena||Crítica literaria - Chile||Crítica literaria||Novela chilena||Literatura chilena - Historia y crítica||Alegría, Fernando, 1918-2005 - Crítica e interpretación"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista Aisthesis n° 3 : el arte de la polémica literaria||Crítica literaria en el Chile neoliberal : la invisibilización de la disidencia||Modos de construcción de la memoria en la primera novela chilena experimental antidictadura. El paso de los gansos (1975) de Fernando Alegría||Los vigilantes, de Diamela Eltit: carta, escritura y poder"", """", """", ""Literary criticism in the neoliberal Chile: the invisibility of the dissent||Ways of Constructing Memory in the First Experimental Antidictatorship Chilean Novel: El paso del ganso (1975) by Fernando Alegria"", """", """", ""Revista Aisthesis n° 3 : el arte de la polémica literaria||Crítica literaria en el Chile neoliberal : la invisibilización de la disidencia||Modos de construcción de la memoria en la primera novela chilena experimental antidictadura. El paso de los gansos (1975) de Fernando Alegría||Los vigilantes, de Diamela Eltit: carta, escritura y poder"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Vol. 60||Vol. 4||Vol. 5"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si"", """", """", ""78572"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2021-07-26;78572;1||2020-08-07;78572;1||2020-10-14;78572;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""72660||76511"", """", """", """", ""1c354827-7ea6-4563-9ae3-83565e321e45||cef99189-2c89-40c5-ba98-9a533d30638a||4f148154-1cd0-45f1-a4ca-a161dda6de40||0162e719-6153-4e8a-8830-556d4d3495c0"", """", """", ""Scielo-2008-2009-2010-2011-2012-2013-2014-2018||Scopus-2012-2013-2014-2015-2016-2018-2019||WOS"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Converis;11-07-2020||Repositorio UC;08-07-2021||Converis;07-08-2020||Converis;02-07-2020||Dialnet;14-10-2020"", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""OSDG;2025-12-22"", """", ""Unpaywall"", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2021-07-26;78572;1||2020-08-07;78572;1||2020-10-14;78572;1"", """"]","[""975c40fc-b111-4877-88a3-c04f77c5f915"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Espinosa Hernández, Patricia"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2020-10-14T19:02:27Z"", """", ""2020-10-14T19:02:27Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2000"", """", """", """", """", """", ""This article addresses the exercise of literary criticism in Chile in the context of the increasingly complex practices of denial of dissent. The non-acceptance of difference that entraps the Chilean society eliminates the discordances by avoiding discourse diversity. The market, then, turns literary criticism into one more link of a book's distribution channels and into a component of the advertising campaign. The crisis that literary criticism and our literature are going through represents only a fraction of the cultural catastrophe brought about by the commercialization of reality as a whole. We are now witnessing a privatization of critical thinking and, consequently, a neutralization of subjectivities; I therefore maintain how urgent it is to, from the reduced territory of subjectivity, vindicate criticism as an act of cultural resistance."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10 páginas"", """", """", """", ""Repositorio UC"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.5195/ct/2016.135"", """", """", """", ""0568-3939"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/207785||https://dialnet.unirioja.es/servlet/articulo?codigo=7009757||https://doi.org/10.5195/ct/2016.135"", """", ""WOS:000404577800001"", """", ""INSTITUTO DE ESTÉTICA;ESPINOSA HERNANDEZ PATRICIA CECILIA;S/I;78572"", """", ""No. 33"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""114"", """", ""105"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Aisthesis: Revista chilena de investigaciones estéticas"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""11 Sustainable cities and communities"", """", ""11 Ciudades y comunidades sostenibles"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Los vig