-22012012000200006"", """", """", """", ""INSTITUTO DE FILOSOFÍA;CAMPOS SALVATERRA VALERIA ROCIO;S/I;127358"", """", ""No. 35"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""105"", """", ""89"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Alpha: revista de artes, letras y filosofía"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""100"", """", """", """", ""Filosofía"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Filosofía||Heidegger, Martin, 1889-1976||Lévinas Enmanuel 1906-1995||Muerte Filosofía"", """", """", ""Muerte||Tiempo||Alteridad||Heidegger||Levinas||Death||Time||Otherness||Heidegger||Levinas"", """", """", """", """", ""Muerte, tiempo y alteridad: más allá de la ontología. Reflexiones sobre la filosofía de M. Heidegger y E. Levinas"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Muerte, tiempo y alteridad: más allá de la ontología. Reflexiones sobre la filosofía de M. Heidegger y E. Levinas"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si"", """", """", ""127358"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2020-09-14;127358;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""de77724e-53dd-471b-b1d4-2fa16ed86938"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Dialnet;14-09-2020||Repositorio UC;08-07-2021"", """", """", ""Validado"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2020-09-14;127358;1"", """"]"
cef5261b-9f05-4985-965f-e3789b86cf1a,5fe56558-7e37-423e-8f3f-5a3a2ea8c217,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""cef5261b-9f05-4985-965f-e3789b86cf1a"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Soler, Fernando||Fernando Soler"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2021-07-21T12:16:12Z||2021-07-21T21:34:58Z"", """", ""2021-07-21T12:16:12Z||2021-07-21T21:34:58Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2018"", """", """", """", """", """", ""The article explores critical elements to understand how Origen elaborates his mystical theology in his Commentary on John. The spiritual progress process implies that rational beings are guided, by God's Logos, from the practical life to the theoretical one becoming son or daughter of God, in the likeness of the Logos. This process aims at knowing the Father as he is known by the Logos. The article has two parts: 1. The Father's presence, through the Logos, in rational beings, and 2. a brief characterisation of the salvation, particularly in the perspective of the mediation by the Son of God."", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Unidad Académica"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""16 páginas"", """", """", """", ""Repositorio UC||Historial Académico"", """", """", """", ""Fernando Soler. Mística del Logos y contemplación del Padre en Orígenes. Aproximaciones desde el comentario a Juan. Teologia Y Vida. 2018;4(59):503-518."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4067/S0049-34492018000400503"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0049-3449"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:85061486754"", """", ""https://doi.org/10.4067/S0049-34492018000400503||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/219338"", """", ""WOS:000456288900002"", """", ""FACULTAD DE TEOLOGÍA;SOLER ESCALONA, FERNANDO ANDRES;S/I;134542||Teología;Fernando Soler;S/I;134542"", """", ""No.