a8bcc620-e260-4f8e-a49d-9c1f41dbaea6,1f3a80e2-9c63-4892-aafe-5e9a0bb4a415,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""a8bcc620-e260-4f8e-a49d-9c1f41dbaea6"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Adams Wrighton, Christopher William||Araneda, Juan Felipe||Morales Verdejo, César||Chávez, Irvin||Manríquez M., Juan Manuel||Mac Leod Carey, Desmond||Katir, Nadia||Castel, A.||Rivière, Pierre||Rivière-Baudet, M.||Dahrouch, M.||Gatica, N.||C.Adams, J. Araneda,..."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2021-03-31T20:06:41Z||2021-07-21T20:44:02Z"", """", ""2021-03-31T20:06:41Z||2021-07-21T20:44:02Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2011||2010"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Polyalkyl-(or chloropolyalkyl)-s-indacenyl anion radicals were obtained from the organodilithium derivatives of the corresponding substituted-1,5-dihydro-s-indacenes by three different methods: (i) UV photolysis, (ii) oxidation by a ferrocenium salt, (iii) single electron transfer reaction from an electron rich olefin. The last reaction (iii) involves transient formation of an unstable polyalkyl-lithio-s-indacenyl imidazolidinium salt. The same salt, obtained by another way by reacting 1,3-dimethylimidazolidinium chloride with the polyalkyl-1,5-dilithio-s-indacene, also leads to the corresponding lithium polyalkyl-s-indacenyl anion radical. All lithium polyalkyl-s-indacenyl anion radicals studied were characterized from their ESR spectra. They present a characteristic symmetrical spin distribution. On the contrary a Rhodium-COD polyalkyl-s-indacene radical presents a non symmetrical spin distribution. (C) 2010 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved."", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""FONDECYT"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Repositorio UC||Historial Académico"", """", """", """", ""C.Adams, J. Araneda,.... Preparation and ESR characterization of lithium polyalkyl-s-indacene anion-radicals from the corresponding polyalkyl-1,5-dithio-s-indacenes.. Inorganica Chimica Acta. 2010;xxx(xx):xxxx-xxxx."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.1016/j.ica.2010.10.002"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0020-1693"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:79251593192"", """", ""https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/273368||https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ica.2010.10.002"", """", ""WOS:000285994200005"", """", ""ESCUELA DE ADMINISTRACIÓN;MANRIQUEZ OSSANDON GINO HERNAN;S/I;87324||Química;C.Adams, J. Araneda,...;S/I;55060"", """", ""No. 1||xx"", """", """", ""en"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""52||xxxx"", """", ""44||xxxx"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""INORGANICA CHIMICA ACTA"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Preparation and ESR characterization of polyalkyl-s-indacenyl anion-radicals from polyalkyl-1,5-dilithio-s-indacenes||Preparation and ESR characterization of lithium polyalkyl-s-indacene anion-radicals from the corresponding polyalkyl-1,5-dithio-s-indacenes."", """", """", """", """", """", ""Preparation and ESR characterization of polyalkyl-s-indacenyl anion-radicals from polyalkyl-1,5-dilithio-s-indacenes||Preparation and ESR characterization of lithium polyalkyl-s-indacene anion-radicals from the corresponding polyalkyl-1,5-dithio-s-indacenes."", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Vol. 366||xxx"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si"", """", """", ""146621||125265||87324||99234||119751||55060"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2021-09-30;146621;1||2021-09-30;125265;1||2021-09-30;87324;1||2021-09-30;99234;1||2021-09-30;119751;1||2021-09-30;55060;1||20