re the only determinants of the dynamics of intergovernmental relations. Informal institutions, such as subnational coalitions and local political clientelism, are particularly relevant to understanding the actual balance of power between national and subnational governments and among subnational arenas."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.1093/acrefore/9780190228637.013.1751"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""http://dx.doi.org/10.1093/acrefore/9780190228637.013.1751||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/404152"", """", """", """", ""Instituto de Ciencia Política; Suarez Cao, Maria Julieta; 0000-0001-5278-5151; 217891"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso restringido"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""16 Peace, justice and strong institutions"", """", ""16 Paz, justicia e instituciones sólidas"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Intergovernmental Relations in Latin America: Determinants and Dynamics"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Intergovernmental Relations in Latin America: Determinants and Dynamics"", ""capítulo de libro"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""217891"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2025-03-03;217891;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID;2025-03-03"", """", """", ""Sin validar"", """", ""OSDG;2025-12-22"", ""