he child with DS. (C) 2015 Sociedad Chilena de Pediatria. Published by Elsevier Espana, S.L.U."", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Unidad Académica"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""7"", """", """", """", ""WOS||Historial Académico"", """", """", """", ""María A. Paul D, Alejandra Bravo V, Constanza Beltrán M, Jaime Cerda L, Daniela Angulo M, Macarena Lizama C. Perfil de morbilidad otorrinolaringológica en niños con síndrome de Down. Revista Chilena De Pediatria. 2015;5(86):318-324."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.1016/j.rchipe.2015.07.008"", """", """", """", ""0717-6228"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0370-4106"", """", """", """", ""MEDLINE:26342393"", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:84946140788"", """", ""https://doi.org/10.1016/j.rchipe.2015.07.008||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/248388"", """", ""WOS:000440793100003"", """", ""Bachillerato; Paul Delfau, Maria De Los Angeles; 0000-0003-3995-3776; 3465||Escuela de Medicina; Cerda Lorca, Jaime Rodrigo; 0000-0003-3463-8304; 3935||Escuela de Medicina; Lizama Calvo, Macarena; 0000-0002-7116-8762; 10944||Medicina;Alejandra Bravo V;S/I;190157||Medicina;Daniela Angulo M;S/I;149117||Medicina;Jaime Cerda L;S/I;3935||Medicina;Macarena Lizama C;S/I;10944||Medicina;María A. Paul D;S/I;3465||Medicina;Constanza Beltran M;S/I;739"", """", ""5||86"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""324"", """", ""318"", """", """", """", """", """", ""SOC CHILENA PEDIATRIA"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""REVISTA CHILENA DE PEDIATRIA-CHILE||Revista Chilena de Pediatria"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""03 Good health and well-being"", """", ""03 Salud y bienestar"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Down syndrome||Trisomy 21||Obstructive sleep apnea syndrome||Hearing l