9899011b-1c8c-4a70-9c24-2335a5705f3f,73f765af-f526-4f3a-beed-4ffbbdd7aac1,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""9899011b-1c8c-4a70-9c24-2335a5705f3f"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Espanol, Alicia||de la Mata, Manuel L.||Cornejo, Marcela||Marcela Cornejo||Alicia Español||Manuel de la Mata"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2022-03-30T14:50:09Z||2021-09-22T00:27:45Z"", """", ""2022-03-30T14:50:09Z||2021-09-22T00:27:45Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2021"", """", """", """", """", """", ""This article develops a theoretical approach to the study of identity narratives from the concept of the bordering process. The first section describes the theoretical concepts that sustain the proposal, in particular, the concept of border as a mediating artifact, the theoretical concept of the bordering process as a social practice, and finally, identity narratives and the dialogical perspective of the self. The second section analyzes the proposals and limitations of some studies on identity narratives in international borderlands. In the same section, we develop our theoretical proposal for studying border identity narratives, which attempts to overcome some limitations of previous studies and respond to the debate on the role of others in the construction of the self. We conclude that the inclusion of the border as a semiotic artifact and the bordering process in the construction of the self provide a new perspective of identity narratives as border narratives for the study of border experiences throughout human development."", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Center of Social Conflict and Cohesion Studies - COES||Millennium Institute on Violence and Democracy - VIODEMOS (ANID-Millennium Science Initiative Program)||Milenio"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""17"", """", """", """", ""WOS||Historial Académico"", """", """", """", ""Alicia Español, Manuel de la Mata, Marcela Cornejo. Border identities: Theoretical approach to the study of self from bordering processes. Theory & Psychology. 2021;31(5):675-691."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.1177/09593543211020129"", """", """", """", ""1461-7447"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0959-3543"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:85107645656"", """", ""https://doi.org/10.1177/09593543211020129||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/366129"", """", ""WOS:000663891100001"", """", ""Escuela de Psicología; Cornejo Cancino Marcela Andrea; S/I; 71400||Psicología;Marcela Cornejo;S/I;71400"", """", ""5"", """", """", ""en"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""691"", """", ""675"", """", """", """", """", """", ""SAGE PUBLICATIONS LTD"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""THEORY & PSYCHOLOGY"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso restringido"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""border||bordering process||dialogical self||narratives||others||DIALOGICAL SELF||CONSTRUCTION"", """", """", """", """", ""Border identities: Theoretical approach to the study of self from bordering processes"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Border identities: Theoretical approach to the study of self from bordering processes"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""31"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si"", """", """", ""71400"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2025-04-29;71400;1||2021-09-21;71400;0"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""86349"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus||WOS||ISI-2004-2012-2013-2014-2015||Scopus-2012-2013-2014"", """", ""Sin revisión"", """", """", """", ""WOS;18-03-2022||Historial Académico;21-09-2021"", """", """", ""Sin Validar"", """", ""OSDG;2025-12-22"", """", ""Unpaywall"", """", ""Validad