fc7b67c3-9f14-48ff-837d-7d0afc12f552,be41c26f-bc48-4a53-83db-0082d71de764,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""fc7b67c3-9f14-48ff-837d-7d0afc12f552"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Kiara Tesen||Hermilo Cortés||Sebastián Vicuña||Edmundo Molina-Perez||Francisco Suárez||Web of Science"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2025-11-03T16:28:20Z||2025-11-03T12:06:48Z"", """", ""2025-11-03T16:28:20Z||2025-11-03T12:06:48Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2025"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.1016/j.engappai.2025.112098"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105015077202"", """", ""https://doi.org/10.1016/j.engappai.2025.112098||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/413630"", """", ""WOS:001570525600005"", """", ""Escuela de Ingeniería; Suarez Poch, Francisco; 0000-0002-4394-957X; 15891"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso restringido"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""06 Clean water and sanitation||09 Industry, innovation and infrastructure"", """", ""06 Agua limpia y saneamiento||09 Industria, innovación e infraestructura"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Groundwater parameters estimation: A hybrid approach of convolutional layers with asynchronous and distributed bio-inspired algorithms"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Groundwater parameters estimati