df91f388-8c7e-47d0-ac4b-36459882d986,aa6aaf5d-b0aa-43f4-aca5-f88d7f2c6195,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.doi,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""df91f388-8c7e-47d0-ac4b-36459882d986"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""vdr"", """", """", """", """", ""Joignant, Alfredo||Somma Gonzalez, Nicolás Manuel||Joignant Rondon, Alfredo||Garretón, Matías||Olivares, Felipe"", """", ""Joignant Rondon, Alfredo||Somma González, Nicolás Manuel"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-01-09T04:56:33Z||2026-01-09T00:26:16Z||2026-01-09T04:44:08Z"", """", ""2026-01-09T04:56:33Z||2026-01-09T00:26:16Z||2026-01-09T04:44:08Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2024"", """", ""2026-01-09T04:56:37Z||2026-01-09T00:26:19Z||2026-01-09T04:44:12Z"", """", """", """", ""This book analyzes collective protests and contentious politics in Chile over a span of 13 years. Utilizing an unprecedented database developed by the Centre for Social Conflict and Cohesion Studies (COES), twenty social scientists provide a systematic overview of conflicts between 2008 and 2020 in the so-called “laboratory of neoliberalism”. Readers will understand different aspects of social protest in Chile in the realms of labor, student activism, pension issues, as well as contentious episodes regarding gender rights, socio-territorial mobilizations, conflicts over memory, and the thorny Mapuche question. Readers will also discover spectacular findings about the popular rebellion of 2019 as well as an inventory of contentious mechanisms and tactical repertoires routinely employed by Chilean civil society groups.||For around 16 years, there were few protests and mobilizations in Chile. It is from 2006 that a cycle of mobilizations and protests begins, with ups and downs, which reaches its highest levels during the social outbreak of 2019. This chapter addresses the frequency and magnitude of these contentious episodes, as well as the type of repertoires used."", """", """", """", """", ""