 """", ""Instituto de Sociología; Somma González, Nicolás Manuel; 0000-0001-8717-3868; 1007923||Instituto de Ciencia Política; Joignant Rondon, Alfredo; S/I; 1001902"", """", """", """", """", ""en"", """", """", """", ""Cham, Switzerland"", """", """", """", ""31"", """", ""9"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Social Protest and Conflict in Radical Neoliberalism: Chile, 2009-2020"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Chile||Social protest||Conflict||Neoliberalism||Protest event analysis"", """", """", """", """", ""Conflict in Chile: frequency, magnitude, and evolution of contentious politics, 2008-2020"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Conflict in Chile: frequency, magnitude, and evolution of contentious politics, 2008-2020"", ""capítulo de libro"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si"", """", """", ""1007923||1001902"", """", ""1/20/2026"", """", """", """", ""2026-01-20;1007923;1||2026-01-20;1001902;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-01-20;1007923;1||2026-01-20;1001902;1"", """"]"
98642455-9c66-4e0f-846e-bbd3556373aa,7db81a41-bb33-4790-8e3e-b4eb6313a205,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""98642455-9c66-4e0f-846e-bbd3556373aa"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""vdr||carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Murray García, Marjorie Neva||Cabaña, Gabriela||Marjorie Murray"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-01-21T22:25:31Z||2026-03-10T12:26:39Z"", """", ""2026-01-21T22:25:31Z||2026-03-10T12:26:39Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2018"", """", """", """", """", """", ""In this chapter we approach the implications of the conditional cash transfer (CCT) program Ingreso Ético Familiar (IEF) in the lives of a group of rural Mapuche women. By focusing on a case study, we tackle the extent to which long-term historical experiences with CCT programs (that do not imply substantial amounts of money), aimed at overcoming poverty, have shaped these women’s self perception as poor. For this, it is necessary to consider that IEF condenses recent social policies, carrying a liberal discourse of autonomy, potentiating women’s entrepreneurial self and a paternalistic model of social intervention. The various encounters with the state that these women have experienced through programs over decades have influenced their sense of identification with poverty as a fundamental category through which they embody citizenship. This sense of poverty entails a twofold temporality: first, of slight but constant ‘progress’ that secures that none of their children would ever ‘fall’ into deprivation. This temporality intersects with a second, erratic one in which unpredictable new programs and professionals appear and disappear. We suggest that further research articulating gender and indigeneity with interventions’ temporalities and citizenships is required to advance knowledge of the concrete impacts of CCTs."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""No aplica"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SIPA||ORCID"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4324/9781351173162"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://doi.org/10.4324/9781351173162||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/416582"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Antropología; Murray García, Marjorie Neva; 0000-0002-8391-4830; 12495"", """", """", """", """", ""en"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Sin adjunto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Taylor & Francis"", """", """", """", """", ""Money from the Government in Latin America. Conditional Cash Transfer Programs and Rural Lives"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso restringido"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""300"", """", """", """", """", ""11 Sustainable cities and communities"", """", ""11 Ciudades y comunidades sostenibles"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Beyond cash, beyond conditional: Ingreso Ético Familiar and the senses of poverty in a group of Mapuche women. In: Money from the Government in Latin America.||Money from the Government in Latin America"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Beyond cash, beyond conditional: Ingreso Ético Familiar and the senses of poverty in a group of Mapuche women. In: Money from the Government in Latin America.||Money from the Government in Latin America"", ""capítulo de libro"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""12495"", """", ""2026-02-27||2026-02-27"", """", """", """", ""2026-01-21;12495;1||2026-03-10;12495;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID;2026-03-10"", """", """", ""Validado||Sin validar"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-01-21;12495;1||2026-03-10;12495;1"", """"]","[""7db81a41-bb33-4790-8e3e-b4eb6313a205"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Marjorie Murray"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-03-10T12:26:39Z"", """", ""2026-03-10T12:26:39Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2018"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4324/9781351173162"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://doi.org/10.4324/9781351173162||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/418589"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Antropología; Murray Garcia, Marjorie Neva; 0000-0002-8391-4830; 12495"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Money from the Government in Latin America"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Money from the Government in Latin America"", ""capítulo de libro"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""12495"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-03-10;12495;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID;2026-03-10"", """", """", ""Sin validar"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-03-10;12495;1"", """"]"
d62785a8-54ce-4a96-972e-3892a8811127,d99a34b9-0eff-46a8-8748-78f55c40187f,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""d62785a8-54ce-4a96-972e-3892a8811127"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""aua||carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Vera Estay, Evelyn Christy||Uribe Torres, Claudia Maria||Veliz Cordova, Soledad Del Carmen||Luna Benavides, Jimena Elvira||Ortega D.N.||Uribe-Torres C.||Alcaina A.R.||Cordova S.V.||Luna-Benavides J.||Estay E.V."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-01-26T16:00:33Z||2026-03-22T14:49:12Z"", """", ""2026-01-26T16:00:33Z||2026-03-22T14:49:12Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2025"", """", ""2026-01-26T16:00:37Z"", """", """", """", ""OBJETIVO. La presente revisión describe cómo regulaciones tanto políticas como programas públicos chilenos orientados a la salud reproductiva responden a la Convención sobre los Derechos de las Personas con Discapacidad (CDPD), al referirse al concepto de  discapacidad, autonomía y accesibilidad, ejes temáticos relevados como desafíos en la atención en salud de personas con discapacidad (PcD) en Chile. METODOLOGÍA.  Se seleccionaron legislaciones, políticas o programas públicos chilenos referidos a la atención en salud reproductiva o a la atención en salud de PcD. En base al corpus se realizó la matriz de análisis con dichos ejes temáticos. RESULTADOS. A partir de los dieciocho  documentos seleccionados, se detectó que la discapacidad es conceptualizada mayoritariamente desde el modelo social, aunque persisten iniciativas desde el modelo biomédico que la nombran sólo como ámbito de prevención. Respecto a la autonomía, pese a que se promueve como principio general, no se expresa en medidas específicas y prácticas dirigidas a la atención en salud de las PcD. Igualmente, aunque la mayoría de las disposiciones incorporan orientaciones generales sobre accesibilidad, esta se refiere principalmente a la información, con escaso abordaje a la accesibilidad de infraestructura, productos y servicios en salud.  CONCLUSIONES. En Chile, pese a que existe un avance en la mirada social y perspectiva de derechos en discapacidad, urge implementar acciones concretas dirigidas a fomentar una atención en salud reproductiva inclusiva y accesible para favorecer la autonomía de las PcD, en la línea de lo planteado por Naciones Unidas en la CDPD.||© 2025, Escuela de Enfermeria Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Chile. All rights reserved.OBJECTIVE. This review identifies and describes how Chilean public policies, legislation, and programs oriented towards reproductive health care respond to the CRPD, particularly in terms of disability, autonomy, and accessibility, which are thematic axes highlighted as challenges in the healthcare of persons with disabilities (PwD) in Chile. METHOD. Chilean public policies, legislation, or programs referring to reproductive health care or health care for PwD were selected. Based on this corpus, a content analysis was conducted using an analysis matrix with defined thematic axes. RESULTS. From the 18 selected documents that met the inclusion criteria, disability is conceptualized mainly from the social model, although there are still initiatives based on the biomedical model that refer to it only as a condition to be prevented. Although autonomy is promoted as a general principle, there are no specific measures and practices aimed at PwD for health promotion to ensure it. Likewise, although most documents incorporate general guidelines on accessibility, they emphasize providing the delivery of accessible information, with limited mention of the physical accessibility of spaces, products, and health services. CONCLUSIONS. In Chile, despite the progress in incorporating a social view of disability and a rights perspective, it is urgent to implement concrete actions aimed at promoting reproductive health care that facilitates support and has sufficient accessibility measures to promote the autonomy of persons with disabilities, respecting the principles established in this regard in the CRPD."", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""FONIS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""12 páginas"", """", """", """", ""SIPA||SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.7764/Horiz_Enferm.36.3.1103-1114"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0716-8861"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105029635688"", """", ""https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/416878||http://dx.doi.org/10.7764/Horiz_Enferm.36.3.1103-1114"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Psicología; Vera Estay Evelyn Christy; S/I; 1076515||Escuela de Enfermería; Uribe Torres Claudia Maria; 0000-0002-0699-7695; 63119||Facultad de Educación; Veliz Cordova Soledad Del Carmen; 0000-0001-7143-420X; 208306||Escuela de Ingeniería; Luna Benavides Jimena Elvira; S/I; 211317||Escuela de Trabajo Social; Rascon Alcaina, Almudena; S/I; 1051123||No Informado; Luna Benavides, Jimena Elvira; S/I; 211317"", """", ""3"", """", """", ""es||spa"", """", """", """", """", """", ""contenido completo"", """", ""1114"", """", ""1103"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Enfermeria Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Chile"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista Horizonte de Enfermeria||Horizonte de Enfermeria"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""610"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Personas con discapacidad||Accesibilidad a servicios de salud||Salud reproductiva||Vida independiente||Health Services Accessibility||Independent Living||Persons with Disability||Reproductive Health"", """", """", """", """", ""Regulación chilena y políticas de salud reproductiva para personas con  discapacidad:  ¿cuán  lejos  respecto  a  lo  establecido  en  