ults indicate that these words increase in frequency at higher levels and are distributed according to the more humanistic or more scientific nature of the subjects and their nature more focused on content or skills. The study concludes by highlighting the importance of examining this vocabulary in order to promote its teaching throughout the entire school trajectory."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.18800/lexis.202502.005"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0254-9239"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105037928898"", """", ""http://doi.org/10.18800/lexis.202502.005||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/422662"", """", """", """", ""Facultad de Letras; Aravena Reyes, Maria Soledad; 0000-0001-8646-9755; 73775||Facultad de letras; Quiroga Moya, Riva Paz; 0000-0002-1147-4135; 224932||Facultad de Letras; Felipe Ignacio Villegas Martinez; S/I; 1193920"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""694"", """", ""659"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Pontificia Universidad Catolica del Peru"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Lexis (Peru)"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""academic vocabulary||disciplinas escolares||school disciplines||textbooks||textos escolares||vocabulario académico"", """", """", """", """", ""Academic Vocabulary of Chilean Textbooks: Analysis of the Words Common to the 4 Core Disciplines of SchoolingVocabulario académico en los textos escolares chilenos: análisis de las palabras comunes a las 4 disciplinas troncales de la escolaridad* **"", """", """", """", """", """", 