s of research undone. The analytical framework helps identify contests over scientific autonomy, validation, and pluralism and advances a clearer picture of how power is exercised, who holds it, and what science is (and is not) useful for."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""17 páginas"", """", """", """", ""SIPA"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.1080/25729861.2025.2574128||10.1080/25729861.2025.2574128"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://doi.org/10.1080/25729861.2025.2574128||https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/25729861.2025.2574128||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/415991"", """", """", """", ""Instituto de Sociología; Simonetti Vicuña, Cristián Enrique; S/I; 119636"", """", ""1"", """", """", ""en"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""17"", """", ""1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Tapuya: Latin American Science, Technology and Society"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Glaciers||Undone science||Scientific autonomy||Climate||Change||Chile"", """", """", """", """", ""Is glacier science undone, or just enough for a just transition? Reflections from Andean Mines"", """", """", ""A ciência dos glaciares é 'não feita', ou é apenas o suficiente para uma transição justa? Reflexões a partir das minas andinas||¿Es la ciencia glaciar inconclusa o logra ser suficiente para avanzar una transición justa?: Reflexiones desde la minería de los Andes"", """", """", ""Is glacier science undone, or just enough for a just transition? Reflections from Andean Mines"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """