52166c4a-2a2a-4b97-95e7-bae22c1f72d2,54a93a00-8cd8-4340-9208-09be08f82b87,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""52166c4a-2a2a-4b97-95e7-bae22c1f72d2"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Neisser-Palominos R.||Uribe-Torres C.||Munoz-Serrano M.||Roberto Neisser-Palominos||Claudia Uribe-Torres||Mónica Muñoz-Serrano"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-03-22T14:55:02Z||2025-11-03T16:29:10Z"", """", ""2026-03-22T14:55:02Z||2025-11-03T16:29:10Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2025"", """", """", """", """", """", ""© 2025, Escuela de Enfermeria Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Chile. All rights reserved.INTRODUCTION. The year 2025 marks the fiftieth anniversary of the creation of the Nurse-Midwife under-graduate program at the School of Nursing of the Pontifical Catholic University of Chile, an initiative that has significantly contributed to women’s health care and the professional development of nursing in the country. OBJECTIVE. The objective of this article is to review the historical, academic, and social foundations that gave rise to this new professional field, and also to analyze the main contributions made over the last five decades in areas such as reproductive, sexual, and gynecological health. DEVELOPMENT. The nurse-midwife professional has played a pioneering role in initiatives aimed at maternal well-being, comprehensive and inclusive childbirth, father participation in the birth process, support for breastfeeding, adherence to cervical cancer screening, and the promotion of sexual and reproductive rights in the Chilean population. Their participation in the development of new areas of the profession and in leadership positions in both public administration and international cooperation views these professionals as key agents in the transformation and strengthening of women’s health. CONCLUSION. Over the past fifty years, the nurse-midwife profession has left a significant legacy in women’s healthcare, remaining at the forefront of the field and responding to the country’s challenges.||INTRODUCCIÓN. El año 2025 corresponde al aniversario número cincuenta de la creación del programa de formación de Enfermera-Matrona de la Escuela de Enfermería de la Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile, una iniciativa que ha contribuido significativamente al cuidado de la salud de la mujer y al desarrollo profesional de la enfermería en el país. OBJETIVO. El objetivo de este artículo es revisar los fundamentos históricos, académicos y sociales que dieron origen a este nuevo profesional, del mismo modo, analizar los principales aportes realizados en las últimas cinco décadas en áreas como la salud reproductiva, sexual y ginecológica. DESARROLLO. El profesional enfermera-matrona(*) ha tenido un rol pionero en iniciativas orientadas al bienestar materno, al parto integral e inclusivo, a la participación del padre en el proceso de nacimiento, al apoyo a la lactancia materna, a la adherencia al tamizaje de cáncer cervicouterino y a la promoción de los derechos sexuales y reproductivos en la población chilena. Su participación en el posicionamiento de nuevas áreas de la profesión y en espacios de liderazgo tanto en la gestión pública como en la cooperación internacional, visualiza a estos profesionales como agentes clave en la transformación y fortalecimiento de la salud de la mujer. CONCLUSIÓN. En estos cincuenta años de existencia, el profesional enfermera-matrona ha dejado un legado importante en el cuidado de la salud de la mujer, siendo vanguardista en el área y dando respuesta a los desafíos país."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS||ORCID"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.7764/Horiz_Enferm.36.2.492-501"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0716-8861"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105019966959"", """", ""http://doi.org/10.7764/Horiz_Enferm.36.2.492-501||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/420675"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Enfermería; Neisser Palominos, Roberto Ignacio; S/I; 195608||Escuela de Enfermería; Uribe Torres, Claudia Maria; 0000-0002-0699-7695; 63119||Escuela de Enfermería; Muñoz Serrano, Monica; 0000-0001-9104-3687; 99967"", """", """", """", """", ""spa"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""501"", """", ""492"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Enfermeria Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Chile"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Horizonte de Enfermeria"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""04 Quality education||05 Gender equality"", """", ""04 Educación de calidad||05 Igualdad de género"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Nurse Midwife||nursing history||reproductive health||sexual health||women’s health"", """", """", """", """", ""NURSE-MIDWIFE: FIFTY YEARS CONTRIBUTING TO THE CARE AND DEVELOPMENT OF WOMEN’S HEALTHENFERMERA-MATRONA: CINCUENTA AÑOS CONTRIBUYENDO AL CUIDADO Y DESARROLLO DE LA SALUD DE LA MUJER||ENFERMERA-MATRONA: CINCUENTA AÑOS CONTRIBUYENDO AL CUIDADO Y DESARROLLO DE LA SALUD DE LA MUJER"", """", """", """", """", """", ""NURSE-MIDWIFE: FIFTY YEARS CONTRIBUTING TO THE CARE AND DEVELOPMENT OF WOMEN’S HEALTHENFERMERA-MATRONA: CINCUENTA AÑOS CONTRIBUYENDO AL CUIDADO Y DESARROLLO DE LA SALUD DE LA MUJER||ENFERMERA-MATRONA: CINCUENTA AÑOS CONTRIBUYENDO AL CUIDADO Y DESARROLLO DE LA SALUD DE LA MUJER"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""36"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""195608||63119||99967"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-07-09;195608;1||2026-07-09;63119;1||2026-07-09;99967;1||2026-07-01;195608;1||2026-07-01;63119;1||2026-07-01;99967;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus"", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS;2026-03-22||ORCID;2025-10-30"", """", """", ""Sin validar"", """", ""OSDG;2025-12-22"", """", ""Unpaywall"", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-07-09;195608;1||2026-07-09;63119;1||2026-07-09;99967;1||2026-07-01;195608;1||2026-07-01;63119;1||2026-07-01;99967;1"", """"]","[""54a93a00-8cd8-4340-9208-09be08f82b87"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Roberto Neisser-Palominos||Claudia Uribe-Torres||Mónica Muñoz-Serrano"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2025-11-03T16:29:10Z"", """", ""2025-11-03T16:29:10Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2025"", """", """", """", """", """", ""INTRODUCCIÓN. El año 2025 corresponde al aniversario número cincuenta de la creación del programa de formación de Enfermera-Matrona de la Escuela de Enfermería de la Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile, una iniciativa que ha contribuido significativamente al cuidado de la salud de la mujer y al desarrollo profesional de la enfermería en el país. OBJETIVO. El objetivo de este artículo es revisar los fundamentos históricos, académicos y sociales que dieron origen a este nuevo profesional, del mismo modo, analizar los principales aportes realizados en las últimas cinco décadas en áreas como la salud reproductiva, sexual y ginecológica. DESARROLLO. El profesional enfermera-matrona(*) ha tenido un rol pionero en iniciativas orientadas al bienestar materno, al parto integral e inclusivo, a la participación del padre en el proceso de nacimiento, al apoyo a la lactancia materna, a la adherencia al tamizaje de cáncer cervicouterino y a la promoción de los derechos sexuales y reproductivos en la población chilena. Su participación en el posicionamiento de nuevas áreas de la profesión y en espacios de liderazgo tanto en la gestión pública como en la cooperación internacional, visualiza a estos profesionales como agentes clave en la transformación y fortalecimiento de la salud de la mujer. CONCLUSIÓN. En estos cincuenta años de existencia, el profesional enfermera-matrona ha dejado un legado importante en el cuidado de la salud de la mujer, siendo vanguardista en el área y dando respuesta a los desafíos país."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.7764/horiz_enferm.36.2.492-501"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105019966959"", """", ""https://doi.org/10.7764/horiz_enferm.36.2.492-501||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/413700"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Enfermería; Neisser Palominos, Roberto Ignacio; S/I; 195608||Escuela de Enfermería; Uribe Torres, Claudia Maria; 0000-0002-0699-7695; 63119||Escuela de Enfermería; Muñoz Serrano, Monica; 0000-0001-9104-3687; 99967"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""04 Quality education||05 Gender equality"", """", ""04 Educación de calidad||05 Igualdad de género"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ENFERMERA-MATRONA: CINCUENTA AÑOS CONTRIBUYENDO AL CUIDADO Y DESARROLLO DE LA SALUD DE LA MUJER"", """", """", """", """", """", ""ENFERMERA-MATRONA: CINCUENTA AÑOS CONTRIBUYENDO AL CUIDADO Y DESARROLLO DE LA SALUD DE LA MUJER"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""195608||63119||99967"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-07-01;195608;1||2026-07-01;63119;1||2026-07-01;99967;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus"", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID;2025-10-30"", """", """", ""Sin validar"", """", ""OSDG;2025-12-22"", """", ""Unpaywall"", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-07-01;195608;1||2026-07-01;63119;1||2026-07-01;99967;1"", """"]"
af73ab42-e3ff-4ed1-9cee-014d00a89e7c,b6ab3b28-6f98-431c-81f8-d215b4847656,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.issn,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""af73ab42-e3ff-4ed1-9cee-014d00a89e7c"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""jlo||carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Puentes Nazal, María José||Gallardo, Ruben Calvo||Lambert, Fabrice||Calvo Gallardo Ruben Ignacio"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2025-12-15T11:57:47Z||2026-04-05T12:01:00Z"", """", ""2025-12-15T11:57:47Z||2026-04-05T12:01:00Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2026"", """", """", """", """", """", ""El balance hidrológico en las regiones montañosas está siendo alterado por el cambio climático. En Chile central, el aumento de temperaturas y disminución de precipitaciones aceleran el retroceso de los glaciares, incrementando inicialmente la escorrentía. Sin embargo, una vez superado el máximo (peak water), la disponibilidad hídrica disminuye a niveles inferiores a los previos al cambio climático. Este estudio evalúa el balance hídrico para el siglo XXI en la cuenca del río Maipo, Chile (33°S). Se desagregan resultados obtenidos de simulaciones con un Modelo de Evaluación Integrada para dos escenarios climáticos; de altas (SSP5-8.5) y bajas (SSP1-2.6) emisiones GEIs. Los resultados indican que la cuenca ya ha superado el peak water y enfrentará un aumento del estrés hídrico. En el escenario de altas emisiones, podría alcanzar el Día Cero, donde la demanda supera la disponibilidad de agua, resaltando la urgencia de estrategias de gestión sustentables del agua.||© 2026 Revista de Geografia Norte Grande. All rights reserved.The hydrological balance in mountainous regions is being altered by climate change. In central Chile, rising temperatures and decreasing precipitation accelerate glacier retreat, initially increasing runoff. However, once the maximum (peak water) is surpassed, water availability decreases to levels below those prior to climate change. This study assesses the water balance for the 21st century in the Maipo River basin, Chile (33°S). Results obtained from simulations with an Integrated Assessment Model are disaggregated for two climate scenarios: high (SSP5-8.5) and low (SSP1-2.6) greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions. The findings indicate that the basin has already surpassed peak water and will face increased water stress. In the high-emission scenario, it could reach Day Zero,where demand exceeds water availability, highlighting the urgency of sustainable water management strategies."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""12/18/2025"", """", """", ""17 páginas"", """", """", """", ""ORCID||SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4067/s0718-34022026000100113"", """", """", """", ""0718-3402"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0718-3402"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105033187577"", """", ""https://doi.org/10.4067/S0718-34022026000100113||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/414896"", """", """", """", ""Instituto de Geografía; Puentes Nazal, María José; S/I; 1192749||Instituto de Geografía; Lambert, Fabrice; 0000-0002-2192-024X; 250043||Instituto de Geografía; Calvo Gallardo Ruben Ignacio; S/I; 1132133"", """", ""93"", """", """", ""es||spa"", """", """", """", """", """", ""contenido completo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista de Geografia Norte Grande"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista de Geografía Norte Grande"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""550"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Cambio Climático||Glaciares de montaña||Peak wate||Estrés hídrico||Climate change||day zero||mountain glaciers||peak water||water stress"", """", """", """", """", ""Evolution of water balance, cost, and stress in the Maipo River basin during the 21st century||Evolution of water balance, cost, and stress in the Maipo River basin during the 21st centuryEvolución del balance hídrico, costo del agua y estrés hídrico en la cuenca del río Maipo durante el siglo XXI"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Evolution of water balance, cost, and stress in the Maipo River basin during the 21st century||Evolution of water balance, cost, and stress in the Maipo River basin during the 21st centuryEvolución del balance hídrico, costo del agua y estrés hídrico en la cuenca del río Maipo durante el siglo XXI"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""1192749||250043||1132133"", """", ""12/18/2025"", """", """", """", ""2025-12-18;1192749;1||2025-12-18;250043;1||2026-07-31;1192749;1||2026-07-31;1132133;1||2026-07-31;250043;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus"", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID;2025-12-15||SCOPUS;2026-04-05"", """", """", ""Validado||Sin validar"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2025-12-18;1192749;1||2025-12-18;250043;1||2026-07-31;1192749;1||2026-07-31;1132133;1||2026-07-31;250043;1"", """"]","[""b6ab3b28-6f98-431c-81f8-d215b4847656"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Puentes Nazal Maria Jose||Calvo Gallardo Ruben Ignacio||Lambert Fabrice"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-04-05T12:01:00Z"", """", ""2026-04-05T12:01:00Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2026"", """", """", """", """", """", ""© 2026 Revista de Geografia Norte Grande. All rights reserved.The hydrological balance in mountainous regions is being altered by climate change. In central Chile, rising temperatures and decreasing precipitation accelerate glacier retreat, initially increasing runoff. However, once the maximum (peak water) is surpassed, water availability decreases to levels below those prior to climate change. This study assesses the water balance for the 21st century in the Maipo River basin, Chile (33°S). Results obtained from simulations with an Integrated Assessment Model are disaggregated for two climate scenarios: high (SSP5-8.5) and low (SSP1-2.6) greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions. The findings indicate that the basin has already surpassed peak water and will face increased water stress. In the high-emission scenario, it could reach Day Zero,where demand exceeds water availability, highlighting the urgency of sustainable water management strategies."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4067/s0718-34022026000100113"", """", """", """", ""0718-3402"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0379-8682"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105033187577"", """", ""http://doi.org/10.4067/s0718-34022026000100113||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/421205"", """", """", """", ""Instituto de Geografía; Puentes Nazal Maria Jose; S/I; 1192749||Instituto de Geografía; Calvo Gallardo Ruben Ignacio; S/I; 1132133||Instituto de Geografía; Lambert Fabrice; 0000-0002-2192-024X; 250043"", """", """", """", """", ""spa"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista de Geografia Norte Grande"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista de Geografia Norte Grande"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Climate change||day zero||mountain glaciers||peak water||water stress"", """", """", """", """", ""Evolution of water balance, cost, and stress in the Maipo R