bient PM2.5 for the three cities, without relying on emission inventories nor long-term RM results. The trends observed in the long-term contribution of RSFB to PM2.5 concentration were significant but small on an annual basis, suggesting that current RSFB regulations should be reconsidered."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""WOS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.1039/d5va00495k"", """", """", """", ""2754-7000"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://doi.org/10.1039/d5va00495k||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/422031"", """", ""WOS:001747685400001"", """", ""Escuela de Ingeniería; Jorquera Gonzalez, Hector Ivan Joaquin; 0000-0002-7462-7901; 100302||Escuela de Ingeniería; Estuardo Norambuena Carolina Andrea; S/I; 1246178"", """", """", """", """", ""en"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ROYAL SOC CHEMISTRY"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE-ADVANCES"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""A novel approach to long-term source contribution of ambient PM<sub>2.5</sub> from residential solid fuel burning using the FUSTA methodology"", """", """", """", """", """", ""A novel approach to long-term source contribution of ambient PM<sub>2.5</sub> from residential solid fuel burning using the FUSTA methodology"", ""artículo||Early Access"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""100302||1246178"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-08-03;100302;1||2026-08-14;1246178;1"", """", """", """", 