 and tara-derived polyphenols as natural strategies to mitigate thermally induced contaminants in processed foods."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.3390/foods15112010"", """", """", """", ""2304-8158"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2304-8158"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105041547810"", """", ""http://doi.org/10.3390/foods15112010||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/423073"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""eng"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Multidisciplinary Digital Publishing Institute (MDPI)"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Foods"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""acrylamide||andean pseudocereals||antioxidants||fluorescent AGEs||maillard reaction||thermal processing"", """", """", """", """", ""Role of Endogenous and Exogenous Phenolic Compounds on the Formation of Acrylamide and Fluorescent Advanced Glycation End Products in Heated Quinoa and Cañihua Flours"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Role of Endogenous and Exogenous Phenolic Compounds on the Formation of Acrylamide and Fluorescent Advanced Glycation End Products in Heated Quinoa and Cañihua Flours"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""15"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus"", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS;2026-06-21"", """", """", ""Sin validar"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", """", """