032e26a4-923e-483f-accf-b2f8cd929d8c,db3ce03c-e189-43b0-8185-81809e19273f,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""032e26a4-923e-483f-accf-b2f8cd929d8c"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""carga||dfo"", """", """", """", """", ""Farfan E.W.||Guzman Gundermann German Enrique||Pardo N.D.||Torres M.Q.||Wagemann, Elizabeth||Donoso, Natalia||Quiroz, Matías"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-07-26T12:02:24Z||2026-05-04T12:54:07Z"", """", ""2026-07-26T12:02:24Z||2026-05-04T12:54:07Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2026"", """", """", """", """", """", ""© 2026 Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Chile. All rights reserved.The destruction of homes after a catastrophe has the potential to affect not only domestic space but also the way in which many people earn their livelihoods. This is the case with emergency housing built in the Atacama region following the 2015 floods, whose users have modified and expanded to accommodate productive activities. By analyzing their adaptation and expansion patterns at household and neighborhood scale, this article underscores the need to overcome the housing/work dichotomy and to understand the home as a “hybrid space,” a topic shown to be critical in post-disaster contexts.||La destrucción de viviendas tras una catástrofe tiene el potencial de afectar no sólo el espacio doméstico, sino la forma en que muchas personas se ganan la vida. Este es el caso de las viviendas de emergencia construidas en la Región de Atacama tras los aluviones de 2015, cuyos usuarios han modificado y ampliado para dar cabida a actividades productivas. Analizando sus patrones de adaptación y expansión a escala familiar y barrial, este artículo subraya la necesidad de superar la dicotomía vivienda/ trabajo y de comprender la casa como un “espacio híbrido”, un tema que se demuestra crítico en contextos posdesastre."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""5/11/2026"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS||ORCID"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.7764/arq.122.10"", """", """", """", ""0717-6996"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0716-0852"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105044367402"", """", ""http://doi.org/10.7764/arq.122.10||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/424543"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Arquitectura; Guzman Gundermann German Enrique; 0009-0008-3459-2338; 186352||Escuela de Arquitectura; Wagemann Farfan, Elizabeth Carolina; 0000-0001-9321-3096; 15646"", """", ""122"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Contenido completo"", """", ""134"", """", ""115"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Chile"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ARQ||ARQ (Santiago)"", """", """", """", ""Atribución/Reconocimiento-NoComercial 4.0 Internacional"", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", ""https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""710"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""1||Domestic plot||Extensions 2||Recovery 4||Social-urban network 5||Transitional neighborhoods 3||Ampliaciones||Barrios transitorios||Recuperación||Tejido sociourbano||Trama doméstica"", """", """", """", """", ""Productive Housing. Domestic and Work Spaces in Emergency Housing in Chile||Vivienda productiva. Espacios domésticos y de trabajo en las viviendas de emergencia en Chile"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Productive Housing. Domestic and Work Spaces in Emergency Housing in Chile||Vivienda productiva. Espacios domésticos y de trabajo en las viviendas de emergencia en Chile"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""186352||15646"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-07-27;186352;1||2026-05-04;15646;1||2026-05-11;186352;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus"", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS;2026-07-26||ORCID;2026-05-04"", """", """", ""Sin validar||Validado"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-07-27;186352;1||2026-05-04;15646;1||2026-05-11;186352;1"", """"]","[""db3ce03c-e189-43b0-8185-81809e19273f"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""dfo"", """", """", """", """", ""Wagemann, Elizabeth||Guzmán Gundermann, German Enrique||Donoso, Natalia||Quiroz, Matías"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-05-04T12:54:07Z"", """", ""2026-05-04T12:54:07Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2026"", """", """", """", """", """", ""La destrucción de viviendas tras una catástrofe tiene el potencial de afectar no sólo el espacio doméstico, sino la forma en que muchas personas se ganan la vida. Este es el caso de las viviendas de emergencia construidas en la Región de Atacama tras los aluviones de 2015, cuyos usuarios han modificado y ampliado para dar cabida a actividades productivas. Analizando sus patrones de adaptación y expansión a escala familiar y barrial, este artículo subraya la necesidad de superar la dicotomía vivienda/ trabajo y de comprender la casa como un “espacio híbrido”, un tema que se demuestra crítico en contextos posdesastre."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""5/11/2026"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.7764/ARQ.122.10"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://doi.org/10.7764/ARQ.122.10||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/422098"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Arquitectura; Wagemann Farfan, Elizabeth Carolina; 0000-0001-9321-3096; 15646||Escuela de Arquitectura; Guzman Gundermann German Enrique; 0009-0008-3459-2338; 186352"", """", ""122"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Contenido completo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ARQ (Santiago)"", """", """", """", ""Atribución/Reconocimiento-NoComercial 4.0 Internacional"", """", ""Acceso abierto"", """", ""https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.es"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""710"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Ampliaciones||Barrios transitorios||Recuperación||Tejido sociourbano||Trama doméstica"", """", """", """", """", ""Vivienda productiva. Espacios domésticos y de trabajo en las viviendas de emergencia en Chile"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Vivienda productiva. Espacios domésticos y de trabajo en las viviendas de emergencia en Chile"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""15646||186352"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-05-04;15646;1||2026-05-11;186352;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""ORCID;2026-05-04"", """", """", ""Validado"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-05-04;15646;1||2026-05-11;186352;1"", """"]"
d48c6987-e974-4ed4-ba3a-03aeeafa19e4,6c7b93b9-9e89-426d-93a3-2b3203ade185,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""d48c6987-e974-4ed4-ba3a-03aeeafa19e4"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""pau||carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Vergara Blanco, Alejandro Basilio"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-03-18T14:38:24Z||2026-07-26T12:03:04Z"", """", ""2026-03-18T14:38:24Z||2026-07-26T12:03:04Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2025"", """", ""2026-03-18T14:38:28Z"", """", """", """", ""El objetivo de este documento es realizar una comparación de dos textos editados por Andrés Bello en 1827 y en 1830, para dar así verosimilitud a la afirmación, que ya circula entre nosotros, según la cual en esos textos se contienen, de manera literal, relevantes fragmentos de obras de Benjamin Constant. La metodología consiste en tomar los textos de Bello y enfrentarlos con los textos de Constant que él tuvo a la vista. El resultado es que se pudo comprobar que en 1827, Bello editó tres fragmentos del primer capítulo del Comentario sobre la obra de Filangieri de Constant, de 1822, tomados de una traducción castellana de la época; y que, además, en 1830, Bello editó la casi integridad del primer capítulo de los Principios de política de Constant, de 1815, al incluirlo como parte de un material de clases de su Curso de Legislación Universal que inició ese año. Bello sólo actúa como editor y no se atribuye la autoría de esos textos.||© 2025 Ediciones Universitarias de Valparaiso. All rights reserved.The objective of this document is to compare two texts edited by Andrés Bello in 1827 and 1830, in order to lend credibility to the assertion, already circulating among us, that these texts contain, verbatim, relevant fragments of the works of Benjamin Constant. The methodology consists of taking Bello’s texts and comparing them with the texts by Constant that he had in view. The result is that it was possible to verify that, on the one hand, in 1827, Bello edited three fragments of the first chapter of Constant’s Commentary on the Work of Filangieri, from 1822, taken from a contemporary Spanish translation; and that, furthermore, in 1830, Bello edited almost the entire first chapter of Constant’s Principles of Politics, from 1815, including it as part of the class material for his Course on Universal Legislation, which he began that year. Bello only acts as editor and does not claim authorship of these texts."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""3/18/2026"", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SIPA||SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4151/ISSN.07176260-Num.47-Fulltext.1363"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0716-5455"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105044368512"", """", ""https://www.rehj.cl/index.php/rehj/index||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/418846"", """", """", """", ""Facultad de Derecho; Vergara Blanco, Alejandro Basilio; S/I; 99933"", """", ""47"", """", """", ""es||spa"", """", """", """", """", """", ""contenido completo"", """", ""566"", """", ""527"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Ediciones Universitarias de Valparaiso"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista de Estudios Historico-Juridicos"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Andrés Bello||Benjamin Constant||Historia de las ideas jurídicas||Comentario sobre la obra de Filangieri||Principios de política||history of legal ideas Commentary on the Work of Filangieri||Principles of Politics"", """", """", """", """", ""Andrés Bello editor de Benjamin Constant: fragmentos del comentario sobre la obra de Filangieri y de los principios de política||[Andrés Bello, editor of Benjamin Constant: Excerpts from the Commentary on Filangieri’s Work and from the Principles of Politics]Andrés Bello editor de BenjAmin ConstAnt: FrAgmentos del Comentario sobre la obra de Filangieri y de los PrinCiPios de PolítiCa"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Andrés Bello editor de Benjamin Constant: fragmentos del comentario sobre la obra de Filangieri y de los principios de política||[Andrés Bello, editor of Benjamin Constant: Excerpts from the Commentary on Filangieri’s Work and from the Principles of Politics]Andrés Bello editor de BenjAmin ConstAnt: FrAgmentos del Comentario sobre la obra de Filangieri y de los PrinCiPios de PolítiCa"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si"", """", """", ""99933"", """", ""3/19/2026"", """", """", """", ""2026-03-19;99933;1||2026-07-27;99933;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus||Redalyc||SciELo||Ebsco host"", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS;2026-07-26"", """", """", ""Validado||Sin validar"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-03-19;99933;1||2026-07-27;99933;1"", """"]","[""6c7b93b9-9e89-426d-93a3-2b3203ade185"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Vergara Blanco Alejandro Basilio"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-07-26T12:03:04Z"", """", ""2026-07-26T12:03:04Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2025"", """", """", """", """", """", ""© 2025 Ediciones Universitarias de Valparaiso. All rights reserved.The objective of this document is to compare two texts edited by Andrés Bello in 1827 and 1830, in order to lend credibility to the assertion, already circulating among us, that these texts contain, verbatim, relevant fragments of the works of Benjamin Constant. The methodology consists of taking Bello’s texts and comparing them with the texts by Constant that he had in view. The result is that it was possible to verify that, on the one hand, in 1827, Bello edited three fragments of the first chapter of Constant’s Commentary on the Work of Filangieri, from 1822, taken from a contemporary Spanish translation; and that, furthermore, in 1830, Bello edited almost the entire first chapter of Constant’s Principles of Politics, from 1815, including it as part of the class material for his Course on Universal Legislation, which he began that year. Bello only acts as editor and does not claim authorship of these texts."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4151/issn.07176260-num.47-fulltext.1363"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0716-5455"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105044368512"", """", ""http://doi.org/10.4151/issn.07176260-num.47-fulltext.1363||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/424561"", """", """", """", ""Facultad de Derecho; Vergara Blanco Alejandro Basilio; S/I; 99933"", """", """", """", """", ""spa"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""566"", """", ""527"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Ediciones Universitarias de Valparaiso"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista de Estudios Historico-Juridicos"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Andrés Bello||Benjamin Constant||history of legal ideas Commentary on the Work of Filangieri||Principles of Politics"", """", """", """", """", ""[Andrés Bello, editor of Benjamin Constant: Excerpts from the Commentary on Filangieri’s Work and from the Principles of Politics]Andrés Bello editor de BenjAmin ConstAnt: FrAgmentos del Comentario sobre la obra de Filangieri y de los PrinCiPios de PolítiCa"", """", """", """", """", """", ""[Andrés Bello, editor of Benjamin Constant: Excerpts from the Commentary on Filangieri’s Work and from the Principles of Politics]Andrés Bello editor de BenjAmin ConstAnt: FrAgmentos del Comentario sobre la obra de Filangieri y de los PrinCiPios de PolítiCa"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""99933"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-07-27;99933;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus"", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS;2026-07-26"", """", """", ""Sin validar"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-07-27;99933;1"", """"]"
2149ea80-7def-49ca-94aa-88a43a294664,6f9da522-6c51-4fbf-92f0-c78ff8b39f58,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.doi,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""2149ea80-7def-49ca-94aa-88a43a294664"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Cánovas, Rodrigo, 1952-"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2020-08-20T15:50:33Z||2020-08-20T15:50:46Z"", """", ""2020-08-20T15:50:33Z||2020-08-20T15:50:46Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2009||1996"", """", """", """", """", """", ""In this work we present an overview of Mexican literature centered in the Lebanese immigration experience. First there is a brief historical introduction about immigration and then we study the following texts: Las tres primeras personas by Hector Azar, Las hojas muertas by Barbara Jacobs, and En el verano, la tierra and Memoria de Libano by Carlos Martinez Assad. In conclusion, these writings make a reflection about the Mexican-Lebanese identity regarding the concepts of the orphan, the otherness and cultural assimilation."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""18 páginas||19 páginas"", """", """", """", ""Repositorio UC"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.4067/S0718-22952008000100005"", """", """", """", ""0716-0798"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0716-0909"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:47149094276"", """", ""https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/262783||https://doi.org/10.4067/S0717-68482009000100002"", """", ""WOS:000273246500002"", """", ""FACULTAD DE LETRAS;CANOVAS EMHART RODRIGO;S/I;99749"", """", ""No. 38||No. 24"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""26||49"", """", ""9||31"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Acta literaria||Taller de letras"", """", """", "