60c82508-48b5-420d-a61c-7d26bd5ecb27,6ccb8bde-571e-4309-983a-28fca1dde596,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.issn,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""60c82508-48b5-420d-a61c-7d26bd5ecb27"", ""123456789/2"", ""e2552"", """", """", """", ""carga"", """", """", """", """", ""Lucchini Raies Camila Estefania||Marquez Doren Francisca Andrea||Salazar P.C.||Marquez-Doren F.||Lucchini-Raies C."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2025-05-09T19:25:38Z||2026-08-16T12:35:18Z"", """", ""2025-05-09T19:25:38Z||2026-08-16T12:35:18Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2022"", """", """", """", """", """", ""© 2022, Universidad Catolica del Uruguay. All rights reserved.Introduction: The World Health Organization recommends exclusive breastfeeding during the first 6 months of life, as well as continuing it supplemented with appropriate foods up, to 2 years and more. Therefore, the need of professional support around it is observed for mothers during pregnancy and once breastfeeding has begun. The World Health Assembly recognized the potential of digital technologies to improve public health, highlighting that the use of eHealth has transformed health, allowing the delivery of care in people’s homes remotely. Objective: To determine if professional support through eHealth is a strategy that favors the support to mothers who are going through the breastfeeding process and improves their breastfeeding results. Methodology: A integrative review was carried out seeking to understand the phenomenon or topic of interest from different perspectives. To carry it out in June 2020, the databases Pubmed, Scopus, CINAHL, ProQuest, ClinicalKey and Science Direct were consulted. Results: They were organized into two groups: professional support strategies through eHealth to mothers in breastfeeding process and results of eHealth as a tool for professional support to mothers in breastfeeding process. Conclusion: eHealth is an effective tool to provide meaningful support to pregnant or breastfeeding women."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""PREI||SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.22235/ECH.V11I1.2552"", """", """", """", ""2393-6606"", """", """", """", """", """", ""1688-8375"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105046253317"", """", ""https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/406132||https://doi.org/10.22235/ECH.V11I1.2552"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Enfermería; Lucchini Raies Camila Estefania; 0000-0001-5704-9778; 18598||Escuela de Enfermería; Marquez Doren Francisca Andrea; 0000-0001-8093-4687; 8328"", """", ""1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""e2552"", """", ""e2552"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Universidad Catolica del Uruguay"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Revista Enfermería: Cuidados Humanizados||Enfermeria"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""breastfeeding||eHealth||mHealth||review literature||telehealth"", """", """", """", """", ""Acompañando la lactancia materna con eHealth: revisión integrativa||Accompanying Breastfeeding with eHealth: Integrative ReviewAcompanhando o aleitamento materno com eHealth: revisão integrativaAcompañando la lactancia materna con eHealth: revisión integrativa"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Acompañando la lactancia materna con eHealth: revisión integrativa||Accompanying Breastfeeding with eHealth: Integrative ReviewAcompanhando o aleitamento materno com eHealth: revisão integrativaAcompañando la lactancia materna con eHealth: revisión integrativa"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""11"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Si""