and the long-term situation of nursing staff, it is necessary to have a human resources information model that is systematic, nationwide, and freely accessible, thereby capturing regional challenges and differences. Further qualitative study on gender gaps remains pending."", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.7764/HORIZ_ENFERM.36.3.1020-1029"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""0716-8861"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS_ID:105028285657"", """", ""http://doi.org/10.7764/HORIZ_ENFERM.36.3.1020-1029||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/420589"", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Enfermería; Gonzalez Aguero, Marcela Margot; S/I; 119783||Escuela de Enfermería; Lucchini Raies, Camila Estefania; 0000-0001-5704-9778; 18598||Escuela de Enfermería; Marquez Doren, Francisca Andrea; 0000-0001-8093-4687; 8328||Escuela de Enfermería; Martinez Santana, Dayann Carolina; 0000-0002-2504-2587; 141576||Escuela de Enfermería; Osorio Leyton, Tatiana Paz; S/I; 205582||No Informado; Bozo Araya, Catalina Concepción; S/I; 223713||Escuela de Enfermería; Isabel Margarita Castillo Valenzuela; S/I; 226343||Escuela de Enfermería; Catoni Salamanca, Maria Isabel; 0009-0006-0131-365X; 637"", """", """", """", """", ""spa"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""1029"", """", ""1020"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Escuela de Enfermeria Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Chile"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Horizonte de Enfermeria"", """", """", """", """", """", ""acceso abierto"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Gender||Health Workforce||Latin America||Nurses||Working Conditions"", """", """", """", """", ""THE STATE OF THE CHILEAN NURSING WORKFORCE IN 2023: LESSONS FOR THE AMERICASSITUACIÓN DEL PERSONAL DE ENFERMERÍA CHILENO EN 2023: ESTUDIO PRELIMINAR"", """", """", """", """", """", ""THE STATE OF THE CHILEAN NURSING WORKFORCE IN 2023: LESSONS FOR THE AMERICASSITUACIÓN DEL PERSONAL DE ENFERMERÍA CHILENO EN 2023: ESTUDIO PRELIMINAR"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""36"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""119783||18598||8328||141576||205582||223713||226343||637"", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-07-01;119783;1||2026-07-01;18598;1||2026-07-01;8328;1||2026-07-01;141576;1||2026-07-01;205582;1||2026-07-01;223713;1||2026-07-01;226343;1||2026-07-01;637;1"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Scopus"", """", """", """", """", """", ""SCOPUS;2026-03-22"", """", """", ""Sin validar"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-07-01;119783;1||2026-07-01;18598;1||2026-07-01;8328;1||2026-07-01;141576;1||2026-07-01;205582;1||2026-07-01;223713;1||2026-07-01;226343;1||2026-07-01;637;1"", """"]"
b9d740b3-dd0a-4cb8-a5c0-6e009d7b2445,e5bd0ddb-21a1-43b7-9efb-1bbde03149dd,identifier,"doi; conflicts=yid,dc.identifier.uri",identifier_conflict,"[""b9d740b3-dd0a-4cb8-a5c0-6e009d7b2445"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""carga||dfo"", """", """", """", """", ""Rojas Contreras Franco Nicolas"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-03-21T16:20:48Z||2026-01-07T15:02:40Z"", """", ""2026-03-21T16:20:48Z||2026-01-07T15:02:40Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2025"", """", """", """", """", """", ""This article critically assesses the validity of Jurgen Moltmann's Theology of Hope 60 years after its publication in 1964. To this end, through the systematic analysis of Theology of Hope and other key bibliographical references, (a) the previous methodological background of this work is considered; (b) its primordial notion Future of Christ is analyzed, which provides a transversal key to reading the future as adventus; and (c) the relevance of the work for the understanding of Christian hope today as a new force that emerges even in the impossibilities of history is glimpsed.||El presente artículo valora críticamente la vigencia de la obra Teología de la Espe-ranza de Jürgen Moltmann, después de 60 años de su publicación en 1964. Para ello, mediante el análisis sistemático de Teología de la Esperanza y otras referencias bibliográficas claves, (a) se consideran los antecedentes metodológicos previos de dicha obra; (b) se analiza su noción primordial Futuro de Cristo que otorga una clave transversal de lectura desde el futuro como adventus; y (c) se vislumbra la relevancia de la obra para la comprensión esperanza cristiana hoy como fuerza novedosa que brota incluso en las imposibilidades de la historia"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""WOS||SIPA"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""10.46553/teo.62.147.2025.p33-67"", """", """", """", ""2683-7307"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0328-1396"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://doi.org/10.46553/teo.62.147.2025.p33-67||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/420214"", """", ""WOS:001555190800002"", """", ""Facultad de Teología; Rojas Contreras Franco Nicolas; 0000-0002-9271-8954; 221660"", """", ""147"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Contenido completo"", """", ""67"", """", ""33"", """", """", """", """", """", ""PONTIFICIA UNIV CATOLICA ARGENTINA, FAC TEOLOGIA"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""TEOLOGIA"", """", """", """", ""Atribución/Reconocimiento 4.0 Internacional"", """", ""Acceso abierto"", """", ""https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.es"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""200"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Future of Christ||Christian Hope||Future||Theology of Hope||Jurgen Moltmann||Futuro de Cristo||Esperanza cristiana||Futuro||Teología de la Esperanza"", """", """", """", """", ""The Future of Hope. 60 Years after Jurgen Moltmann's<i> Theology</i><i> of</i><i> Hope</i>||El futuro de la esperanza. A 60 años de Teología de la esperanza de Jürgen Moltmann"", """", """", """", """", """", ""The Future of Hope. 60 Years after Jurgen Moltmann's<i> Theology</i><i> of</i><i> Hope</i>||El futuro de la esperanza. A 60 años de Teología de la esperanza de Jürgen Moltmann"", ""artículo"", """", """", """", """", """", ""62"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""221660"", """", ""1/16/2026"", """", """", """", ""2026-07-09;221660;1||2026-01-16;221660;1"", """", """", """", """", """", ""WOS_ID: LZE-7852-2025"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""WOS"", """", """", """", """", """", ""WOS;2026-03-20"", """", """", ""Sin validar||Validado"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Validado"", """", ""2026-07-09;221660;1||2026-01-16;221660;1"", """"]","[""e5bd0ddb-21a1-43b7-9efb-1bbde03149dd"", ""123456789/2"", """", """", """", """", ""dfo"", """", """", """", """", ""Rojas Contreras, Franco Nicolás"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2026-01-07T15:02:40Z"", """", ""2026-01-07T15:02:40Z"", """", """", """", """", ""2025"", """", """", """", """", """", ""El presente artículo valora críticamente la vigencia de la obra Teología de la Espe-ranza de Jürgen Moltmann, después de 60 años de su publicación en 1964. Para ello, mediante el análisis sistemático de Teología de la Esperanza y otras referencias bibliográficas claves, (a) se consideran los antecedentes metodológicos previos de dicha obra; (b) se analiza su noción primordial Futuro de Cristo que otorga una clave transversal de lectura desde el futuro como adventus; y (c) se vislumbra la relevancia de la obra para la comprensión esperanza cristiana hoy como fuerza novedosa que brota incluso en las imposibilidades de la historia"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""SIPA"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""2683-7307"", """", """", """", """", """", ""0328-1396"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""https://doi.org/10.46553/teo.62.147.2025.p33-67||https://sipa.uc.cl/handle/123456789/415625"", """", """", """", ""Facultad de Teología; Rojas Contreras Franco Nicolas; 0000-0002-9271-8954; 221660"", """", ""147"", """", """", ""es"", """", """", """", """", """", ""Contenido completo"", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", """", ""Teología"", """", """", """", ""Atribución/Reconocimiento 4.0 Internacional"", """", ""Acceso abierto"", """", ""https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.es"", """"